## Description

Introducing Headlong, an open source microharness for persistent agents: self-guided agents that think continuously.  Most agent harnesses are reactive: you send a task, the agent completes it, and then it sits frozen until the next request. Cron jobs and heartbeats wake it up to https://t.co/wgT6PHph5Q

